 "readme": "# Synthetic Credit-Card Portfolio Simulator\n\nThis repo builds a *fully synthetic* but behaviorally plausible credit-card\nportfolio, fits ML models for spend, default, and churn, embeds them inside a\nMesa agent-based environment, and exposes an interactive Streamlit dashboard\nfor policy exploration.\n\n## Quick Start\n\npython data_generation.py # customers.parquet\n\npython modeling.py # trains & saves 3 models\n\nstreamlit run app.py # interactive dashboard\n\n\n## How the pieces fit\n\n| Layer | Purpose | Key Tech |\n|-------|---------|----------|\n| Data fabrication | Create statistically coherent customer base | SDV CTGAN, Faker |\n| Predictive ML | Estimate monthly spend, default odds, churn odds | scikit-learn GBDT |\n| Agent-based simulation | Heterogeneous customers act & learn each month | Mesa |\n| Scenario engine | Apply arbitrary policy levers; compare KPIs | custom |\n| Dashboard | Real-time what-if sliders & plots | Streamlit + Plotly |\n\n\n",
